<title>ITALY: S&amp;P affirms Cariplo ratings, downgrades outlook.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms Cariplo ratings, downgrades outlook.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Tuesday it affirmed its 'A+/A-' counterparty ratings for Italian largest savings bank, Cassa di Risparmio delle Provincie Lombarde Spa (Cariplo).</p>
<p>But S&amp;P said in a statement it was downgrading its outlook on Cariplo's long-term rating to negative from stable.</p>
</text>
